20	/*!
21	 * \file merge_shared_memory_allocations.cc
22	 * \brief Each GPU kernel is allowed to have only one dynamic or static shared
23	 * memory allocation. This pass merges multiple TIR-level dynamic or static
24	 * shared memory allocations into one allocation.
